00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:11.750
The first location,
again, is that PubSub,

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:14.630
so that it actually can talk
to the factories downstream.

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:17.620
The other location is
actually to Firebase.

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:19.370
And the reason I'm
sending it to Firebase?

00:12:19.370 --> 00:12:21.810
Well, I'm going
to show you here.

00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:23.840
So this is that basic test.

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:26.510
It's that information being
