00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:38.060
Now I can actually
visualize this in things

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:42.824
like graphs that connect
to the Firebase engine.

00:12:42.824 --> 00:12:44.240
And as you'll
notice, you actually

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:46.400
